   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2",
    "PLO3"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain the concept of implicit threading in operating systems. Discuss its techniques, benefits, and threading-related issues such as race conditions, deadlocks, and starvation.</p>\n",
